Cell[TextData[{
 "The",
 StyleBox[" Creating Intelligence",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " project develops a computational framework for AGI, framed in set theory \
and designed around population coding and topological associative memory.  \
This document is a practical  introduction to designing macro-scale neural \
circuits within this framework. Circuits represent stateful machines that \
process hyperdimensional sparse distributed representations (SDRs) and sparse \
holographic representations (SHRs)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"87579e7b-f6a0-41f8-82c2-9eb95fc7b7df"],

Cell["\<\
A JSON dataflow description language  fully specifies circuits composed of \
standardized building blocks:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ff9293d6-529a-4cc5-b93f-c817ac552344"],

